WEBVTT

00:01.350 --> 00:04.480
Tell me the password.

00:04.480 --> 00:08.650
Mycroft was lying when he said
you were trying to blackmail Moran.

00:08.650 --> 00:14.330
You're not after money. You want
the contents of the drive itself.

00:17.660 --> 00:19.000
Perfect deduction.

00:19.000 --> 00:20.920
Huh? Really?

00:20.920 --> 00:23.540
I can't imagine someone
like her taking a big risk

00:23.540 --> 00:27.130
blackmailing Moran just days
before marrying someone rich.

00:27.130 --> 00:28.510
Now open it up.

00:28.510 --> 00:31.510
I don't know the password myself.

00:31.510 --> 00:36.760
That's why my plan was to get out of
Japan where I could crack it in peace.

00:36.760 --> 00:39.020
Why go through all that effort?

00:43.440 --> 00:46.480
Well, have a good time trying to get it open.

00:49.280 --> 00:53.070
Where did Jack the Ripper vanish to?

00:53.070 --> 00:57.030
It's been six months since the murder
of Ward Mayor Moran's daughter,

00:57.030 --> 00:58.410
and no new murders have occurred since then.

00:58.410 --> 00:59.790
"Murders stopped after the death of
Ward Mayor Moran's daughter Alexandra"

00:59.790 --> 01:01.830
I want to find the man who killed
my daughter as soon as possible...

01:01.830 --> 01:02.710
"A Word From Ward Mayor Moran"

01:02.710 --> 01:07.590
But the wounds of the surviving
families will never heal.

01:07.590 --> 01:12.300
The serial killer is still out there somewhere,
looking for his next targ--

01:21.140 --> 01:22.480
Sorry.

01:22.480 --> 01:25.190
That's something you don't see every day.

01:29.900 --> 01:31.360
Irene- <i>san</i> !

03:08.420 --> 03:08.580
What are you doing here?

03:08.580 --> 03:09.710
"Don't Take Off the Swimsuit"

03:08.580 --> 03:09.710
What are you doing here?

03:09.710 --> 03:11.880
None of your business.

03:12.630 --> 03:14.590
She's helping out around the bar.

03:14.590 --> 03:16.050
What?

03:16.050 --> 03:19.510
You know how Mrs. Hudson's
had bad back pain recently, right?

03:19.510 --> 03:23.350
So she said she'd get a room
nearby and help out!

03:23.350 --> 03:26.430
Wow, what an angel!

03:26.430 --> 03:29.270
Go clean the bathrooms, please!

03:29.270 --> 03:31.150
Roger!

03:32.610 --> 03:35.110
I eliminated the filth from
around the beer taps.

03:35.110 --> 03:39.700
So if you could talk to someone
and get me an ID for the West Side--

03:39.700 --> 03:41.320
Clean below the sink, too.

03:41.320 --> 03:43.410
Understood!

03:43.410 --> 03:44.080
Pathetic.

03:44.080 --> 03:45.700
Hey there.

03:50.540 --> 03:51.880
Hey, Moriarty.

03:51.880 --> 03:52.920
Hi there.

03:52.920 --> 03:55.880
Wow, what a cute kid.

03:55.880 --> 03:59.760
Wow, we hired an old lady
to be our new part-timer.

04:01.640 --> 04:03.720
Thank you so much!

04:03.720 --> 04:04.890
Here you go!

04:08.680 --> 04:10.270
When do I need to give it back?

04:10.270 --> 04:12.150
It's yours forever.

04:12.150 --> 04:13.310
You're leaving already?

04:13.310 --> 04:14.320
Yeah.

04:22.570 --> 04:25.790
Mrs. Hudson, is your back okay?

04:25.790 --> 04:29.910
It's not a bad back. It's just
that time of the month.

04:29.910 --> 04:33.420
Get started.

04:33.420 --> 04:33.880
My name is Yui Shirota.

04:33.880 --> 04:35.880
"Client"

04:35.880 --> 04:38.800
My old husband is trying

04:38.800 --> 04:40.130
to steal away my daughter, Emiri.

04:40.130 --> 04:43.720
"Client's Daughter"

04:43.840 --> 04:46.470
He found another woman and left me

04:46.470 --> 04:49.560
almost immediately after I got pregnant.

04:49.560 --> 04:56.480
After that, Emiri and I never had much money,
but we were happy together.

04:56.480 --> 04:59.070
But last week...

04:59.070 --> 05:04.370
My husband, who'd never bothered filing
for divorce, called me out of nowhere...

05:04.370 --> 05:07.370
And said he wanted to take Emiri.

05:07.370 --> 05:09.200
Why?

05:09.200 --> 05:13.710
I don't know. Of course, I refused.

05:13.710 --> 05:16.920
And he threatened me with my secret.

05:16.920 --> 05:18.840
Secret?

05:18.840 --> 05:22.300
I've always had a weak constitution,

05:22.300 --> 05:25.720
and last year, all the stress
caught up with me...

05:25.720 --> 05:31.520
The doctors said it would be difficult
for me to raise a child on my own.

05:31.520 --> 05:35.600
But I can't imagine leaving my daughter.

05:35.600 --> 05:39.150
So I paid the doctor off...

05:39.150 --> 05:42.320
And I was sent this.

05:42.320 --> 05:45.570
This medical chart has the
real name of my disease.

05:45.570 --> 05:47.280
If I don't hand her over,

05:47.280 --> 05:51.160
he'll turn it over to the courts
and sue for parental rights.

05:51.160 --> 05:54.830
So you want us to find the original?

05:54.830 --> 05:57.540
Yes. And steal it.

05:57.540 --> 06:03.380
So this is S Rank, no bonus. One million yen.

06:03.380 --> 06:07.050
I'm busy. I'll be passing.

06:07.050 --> 06:09.140
You just want to fap, don't you?

06:09.140 --> 06:12.310
So what's your ex like?

06:12.310 --> 06:14.730
His name is Milverton.

06:14.730 --> 06:20.820
He used to write for a weekly paper,
but when I asked, I was told he retired.

06:20.820 --> 06:26.490
A former co-worker heard that
he was probably working in Kabukicho.

06:26.490 --> 06:28.870
But they had no idea where...

06:28.870 --> 06:31.540
So it'll be easy, then.

06:31.540 --> 06:36.210
It's easy for us to find
somebody in Kabukicho.

06:36.210 --> 06:39.250
I've never seen him though...

06:40.670 --> 06:42.000
What will you do?

06:42.000 --> 06:44.130
This is stupid. I'm not taking it, obviously.

06:44.130 --> 06:46.340
I'm in.

06:49.800 --> 06:54.140
Okay. Nobody's using Sherlock's pager.

06:54.140 --> 06:58.440
I'll be your partner today.
Let's do our best, Johnwa Kobayashi- <i>san</i> .

06:58.440 --> 06:59.440
Huh?

06:59.440 --> 07:01.190
Did you call?

07:01.190 --> 07:04.400
"Detective's Row House"
When the sun sets in other towns,

07:04.400 --> 07:07.530
in our town the neon lights turn on.

07:07.530 --> 07:10.570
If you want gold and silver...

07:10.570 --> 07:13.700
...steal the secret that would
tear apart daughter and mother.

07:13.700 --> 07:16.370
A light shines in the detective' eyes.

07:16.370 --> 07:20.000
This row house is filled
with the strangest of men,

07:20.000 --> 07:24.050
and people call it,
"The Detective's Row House."

07:25.550 --> 07:29.640
A million yen to the person
who finds Yuiyui's medical chart.

07:29.640 --> 07:31.970
Ready... go!

07:35.930 --> 07:37.730
Hey!

07:37.730 --> 07:40.810
Are you okay? You look red.

07:40.810 --> 07:43.570
Oh, no! Your fever is terrible!

07:43.570 --> 07:45.190
I'm taking you to the hospital.

07:45.190 --> 07:47.700
Sherlock, hold down the fort!

08:01.500 --> 08:03.420
"Detective Section"

08:24.360 --> 08:26.480
Yuck!

08:27.280 --> 08:29.650
"Mahjong Parlor on the
Outskirts of Kabukicho"

08:30.280 --> 08:32.820
Um, what are we doing here?

08:33.820 --> 08:37.120
If he lives here in this city and
Mrs. Hudson doesn't know him,

08:37.120 --> 08:40.290
there must be a pretty good reason.

08:40.290 --> 08:42.250
There.

08:42.250 --> 08:43.210
Who's that?

08:43.210 --> 08:44.920
"Don of the Publishing World"

08:43.210 --> 08:44.920
Tony Shigeru.

08:44.920 --> 08:47.340
The don of the publishing world.

08:47.340 --> 08:48.340
Nothing happens in the industry
without him knowing it.

08:51.050 --> 08:53.390
Milverton was a former journalist.

08:54.510 --> 08:58.100
What does the famous
Irene Adler want with me?

08:58.100 --> 09:02.270
I want info on Milverton.

09:02.270 --> 09:04.690
And what's in it for me?

09:04.690 --> 09:06.190
Money?

09:06.190 --> 09:09.990
I'm not interested in that.

09:09.990 --> 09:12.700
What about a scoop on the mayor?

09:15.120 --> 09:17.410
So Moran lied about his degrees, huh?

09:17.410 --> 09:19.500
That's a good scoop.

09:19.500 --> 09:23.290
I call Milverton the king of all blackmailers.

09:23.290 --> 09:25.290
The king of all blackmailers?

09:25.290 --> 09:30.010
He finds information on celebrities
and uses it to blackmail them.

09:30.010 --> 09:33.590
On the surface, he's a
successful entrepreneur, though.

09:33.590 --> 09:34.800
Running what kind of business?

09:34.800 --> 09:36.220
Lots.

09:36.220 --> 09:40.390
He uses a variety of fake names
to operate in several different fields.

09:40.390 --> 09:42.230
I'll send you a list later.

09:42.230 --> 09:44.440
Do you know where he lives?

09:45.900 --> 09:50.150
I've heard he sleeps out of
one of his businesses.

09:50.150 --> 09:53.780
But I don't know which one.

09:53.780 --> 09:56.120
So we'll have to hit them
all up one by one, huh?

09:56.120 --> 09:57.070
By the way,

09:57.070 --> 10:01.040
he supposedly has been making nightly
visits to a favorite place of his.

10:01.040 --> 10:05.370
And he looks completely different
than he did when he was a reporter.

10:05.370 --> 10:10.130
I was so astonished by the change
that I wrote a poem!

10:10.130 --> 10:12.800
What do you mean?

10:12.800 --> 10:15.380
What's in it for me?

10:17.090 --> 10:18.510
Fine.

10:18.510 --> 10:20.810
I'll give you a scoop on me next.

10:22.980 --> 10:25.390
How about Moran's measurements?

10:25.390 --> 10:27.940
No way. He's an old man, not some young girl.

10:27.940 --> 10:29.570
Then what is it?

10:33.900 --> 10:36.320
Hey, what are you doing?

10:40.450 --> 10:41.950
Give that back!

10:41.950 --> 10:43.700
Stop!

10:41.950 --> 10:43.700
Give that back!

10:45.620 --> 10:47.790
Don't cry! Please!

10:50.290 --> 10:52.340
Piggy! Mr. Piggy!

10:55.840 --> 10:57.260
I'm exhausted...

10:57.260 --> 11:01.430
We searched everywhere and came up
completely empty-handed, huh?

11:02.680 --> 11:05.640
"House of Five Laughs
Tsurutake"

11:22.030 --> 11:24.410
"Flower Viewing Bar Arinsu"

11:24.410 --> 11:24.750
"Life Insurance"

11:24.750 --> 11:26.620
Irene- <i>san</i> , this is the place
Shigeru- <i>san</i> was talking about, right?

11:28.830 --> 11:29.960
Yes. That's right.

11:29.960 --> 11:34.050
I looked around the shop and I don't
see anybody matching his description.

11:37.090 --> 11:39.260
And this information tells me exactly nothing!

11:39.260 --> 11:41.350
"He's Like Othello Shigeru"

11:41.600 --> 11:44.060
I'm not interested in complaints.

11:47.020 --> 11:48.890
Got it!

11:48.890 --> 11:50.020
Tell the girl who just took the beer

11:50.020 --> 11:51.860
Dark skin, round ears...

11:51.860 --> 11:55.690
to table 8 that she needs to show more leg.

11:55.690 --> 11:57.650
White skin, round ears.

11:57.650 --> 11:59.530
White to black!

11:59.530 --> 12:01.320
Just like Othello!

12:02.700 --> 12:05.950
Irene, I found Milverton!

12:07.250 --> 12:09.830
Meet me in Sherlock's room tomorrow.

12:09.830 --> 12:12.170
"King of the Blackmailers"

12:09.830 --> 12:12.170
Okay, see you later.

12:12.170 --> 12:14.800
Sir?

12:14.800 --> 12:16.920
I'm with Kabuki Insurance.

12:16.920 --> 12:21.430
I'd like to talk to you about the
Smile Plan your company's enrolled in.

12:30.390 --> 12:32.100
Hey, look.

12:32.100 --> 12:34.270
That's Agatha Kuroki, right?

12:34.270 --> 12:36.070
The actress who cheated on her husband?

12:36.070 --> 12:36.480
Man, I'd love to take her for a roll in the hay!

12:36.480 --> 12:39.110
This month's payment is due tonight.

12:39.110 --> 12:40.570
I just need a little more time.

12:40.570 --> 12:43.910
No. The boss never gives extra time.

12:43.910 --> 12:45.370
You've got less than an hour.

12:45.370 --> 12:47.240
Wait. I'll pay... So...

12:47.240 --> 12:47.870
"Former Nationally-Known Actress"

12:47.240 --> 12:47.870
Wait. I'll pay... So...

12:47.870 --> 12:50.620
How much do you need?

12:51.540 --> 12:53.040
Irene?

12:56.670 --> 12:59.920
It's been a long time since we were co-stars.

12:59.920 --> 13:02.180
Yeah.

13:02.180 --> 13:04.550
What were you doing in a place like that?

13:04.550 --> 13:07.220
I'll pay you back. I swear.

13:07.220 --> 13:08.520
Forget it.

13:09.890 --> 13:14.150
He's got a secret I can't have
getting out into the papers.

13:14.150 --> 13:20.570
He demanded I give him monthly
payments, as well as my body.

13:20.570 --> 13:23.700
But the news about my cheating cost me work.

13:23.700 --> 13:25.370
I can't pay him anymore.

13:25.370 --> 13:27.200
Don't give him another dime.

13:27.200 --> 13:29.370
You'll be paying the rest of your life.

13:29.370 --> 13:30.330
But...

13:30.330 --> 13:32.910
You can't let a guy like that beat you.

13:32.910 --> 13:37.170
No matter what, I'm on your side.

13:37.170 --> 13:38.250
Thanks.

13:38.250 --> 13:41.880
Talking to you made me feel a little better.

13:46.180 --> 13:47.220
What are you doing here?

13:47.220 --> 13:49.310
Don't mind me.

13:49.310 --> 13:52.020
Emiri- <i>chan</i> forgot her picture book.

13:52.020 --> 13:54.730
"The Truth About Agatha Kuroki
Plastic Surgery and Sex Change"

13:55.060 --> 13:55.850
Hello?

13:55.850 --> 13:57.360
It's open.

13:59.820 --> 14:01.940
Milverton!

14:01.940 --> 14:03.450
I called him here.

14:03.450 --> 14:06.450
I couldn't believe it.

14:06.450 --> 14:10.160
I got a call from you
and we've never even met.

14:10.160 --> 14:11.330
What are you doing?

14:11.330 --> 14:13.870
Stinky pig.

14:13.870 --> 14:15.540
Let's get to the point.

14:15.540 --> 14:18.790
You're hiring minors at your store, aren't you?

14:18.790 --> 14:20.420
I don't know what you're talking about.

14:20.420 --> 14:23.130
The customers like 'em young!

14:23.130 --> 14:26.050
They're all middle school girls,
high school at the latest!

14:26.050 --> 14:28.510
College girls are too old!

14:28.510 --> 14:30.680
You're the woman from yesterday...

14:30.680 --> 14:33.640
Will you give us Yui Shirota's medical chart?

14:33.640 --> 14:37.190
What, the girl sent you?

14:37.190 --> 14:41.070
Sure. Take the video to the cops if you want.

14:41.070 --> 14:44.610
I can have it covered up.

14:44.610 --> 14:49.280
I've got all kinds of nasty secrets
about the police higher-ups.

14:49.280 --> 14:50.200
I see.

14:50.200 --> 14:53.830
We'll do this another way, then.

14:53.830 --> 14:55.210
Whatever you want.

14:55.210 --> 14:56.620
Tell me.

14:56.620 --> 14:59.420
Agatha paid you yesterday, right?

14:59.420 --> 15:01.880
So why'd you go public with the information?

15:01.880 --> 15:04.420
She was five seconds late with her payment.

15:04.420 --> 15:06.800
Bye.

15:04.420 --> 15:06.800
Hey, black-haired pig.

15:06.800 --> 15:08.090
What?

15:08.090 --> 15:10.720
Who are you going to sell Emiri to?

15:10.720 --> 15:13.220
You figured that out, huh?

15:13.220 --> 15:16.480
I know a rich guy who likes 'em young.

15:16.480 --> 15:21.150
He's going to "adopt" my daughter.

15:21.150 --> 15:23.150
Bye now.

15:25.940 --> 15:28.030
What a terrible human being!

15:28.030 --> 15:30.200
Let's steal the chart.

15:30.200 --> 15:32.200
I'm sure it must be...

15:32.200 --> 15:35.120
Milverton's office.

15:35.120 --> 15:38.750
Now, old man, where's the black pig's office?

15:38.750 --> 15:42.380
What, you're not even trying
to figure it out yourself?

15:42.380 --> 15:44.670
You could smell something on him, right?

15:44.670 --> 15:46.550
What is this?

15:44.670 --> 15:46.550
Sure did! He smelled terrible!

15:46.550 --> 15:48.300
Mystery-solving <i>rakugo</i> .

15:46.550 --> 15:48.300
Sure did! He smelled terrible!

15:48.300 --> 15:49.890
That's chlorine.

15:49.890 --> 15:52.010
And did you see his eyes?

15:52.010 --> 15:55.520
Yeah. They were bright red,
like a monkey's ass!

15:55.520 --> 15:57.520
You're disgusting.

15:57.520 --> 15:58.560
Listen.

15:58.560 --> 15:59.520
Red eyes and chlorine can only mean--

15:59.520 --> 16:01.900
A nighttime pool.

15:59.520 --> 16:01.900
Red eyes and chlorine can only mean--

16:01.900 --> 16:05.280
It's in the safe at a nighttime pool.

16:05.280 --> 16:05.980
Let's go.

16:05.980 --> 16:07.990
Oh, right!

16:09.990 --> 16:13.240
Maki- <i>chan</i> , would you be willing to sign this?

16:13.240 --> 16:15.290
Why do you have that?

16:15.490 --> 16:17.450
"Nighttime Pool"

16:29.260 --> 16:30.260
The office is...

16:30.260 --> 16:31.720
This way.

16:36.930 --> 16:38.350
Here.

16:38.350 --> 16:40.730
It's guarded.

16:40.730 --> 16:43.440
Hmm... How do we get in?

16:45.270 --> 16:46.650
What?

16:50.490 --> 16:51.530
Go cause chaos.

16:51.530 --> 16:52.700
"Wa"

16:51.530 --> 16:52.700
That's terrible!

16:54.070 --> 16:55.830
Hey!

16:54.070 --> 16:55.830
Hold it, pervert!

16:55.830 --> 16:58.040
Get out of the pool!

16:58.040 --> 17:00.540
Wow, you're a bold one.

17:00.620 --> 17:04.290
"Milverton's Office"

17:06.590 --> 17:09.760
Now, where's the treasure?

17:09.760 --> 17:15.680
Good question. Thinking back, that chlorine
stench on the pig was really strong.

17:15.680 --> 17:18.560
Right? It was terrible.

17:20.810 --> 17:24.400
Even if his bed's right next to a pool...

17:24.400 --> 17:29.030
He must be soaking in the water every night...

17:33.240 --> 17:36.070
You're curious how I knew, right?

17:44.790 --> 17:47.250
A friend told me.

17:49.340 --> 17:51.130
The hell's going on here?

17:51.130 --> 17:54.090
Where are the damn guards?

17:55.430 --> 17:57.800
Get your shit together...

18:08.520 --> 18:10.940
<i>Jugemu Jugemu Goko-no surikire</i>
<i>Kaijarisuigyo-no Suigyomatsu</i>

18:10.940 --> 18:14.740
<i>Unraimatsu Furaimatsu</i>
<i>Kuunerutokoro-ni Sumutokoro...</i>

18:17.820 --> 18:19.410
<i>Yaburakoji-no burakoji...</i>

18:19.410 --> 18:20.490
<i>Jugemu Jugemu Goko-no surikire...</i>

18:20.490 --> 18:22.870
Shut up!

18:30.630 --> 18:33.090
What do you want?

18:34.380 --> 18:36.550
No! Don't do it!

19:00.240 --> 19:02.910
<i>Ponpokopi!</i>

19:02.910 --> 19:04.370
We're leaving.

19:10.590 --> 19:13.300
"Hanazono Shrine"

19:26.600 --> 19:27.940
What happened?

19:27.940 --> 19:29.400
A murder!

19:29.400 --> 19:31.230
Seriously? Who was killed?

19:31.230 --> 19:32.520
No idea!

19:34.940 --> 19:36.650
Who are you?

19:36.650 --> 19:37.900
Irene!

19:39.320 --> 19:42.620
They'll catch you, Agatha.

19:42.620 --> 19:44.790
You're here for this, right?

19:49.250 --> 19:51.040
Run.

19:51.040 --> 19:54.630
"Miyako"

19:51.040 --> 19:54.630
You saved a lot of people.

19:56.670 --> 20:02.260
If you found what you're after,
then you don't need to be here anymore.

20:02.260 --> 20:04.680
So go.

20:04.680 --> 20:07.100
Before I change my mind.

20:09.390 --> 20:10.690
Thank you.

20:14.570 --> 20:16.900
"Medical Chart"
"Yui Shirota | Born 3/3/1991"

20:17.150 --> 20:20.360
Thank you... Thank you so much!

20:20.360 --> 20:23.410
I don't know how to thank you!

20:23.410 --> 20:25.660
Let's play again sometime, mister!

20:25.660 --> 20:27.540
Thanks for this!

20:29.370 --> 20:31.960
Never again.

20:31.960 --> 20:33.840
Let's get going, Emiri.

20:33.840 --> 20:35.630
I'll show you out.

20:35.630 --> 20:37.170
Bye-bye!

20:37.170 --> 20:39.050
See you later!

20:40.800 --> 20:45.310
She may have seen herself in Emiri.

20:45.310 --> 20:47.640
I see.

20:47.640 --> 20:49.270
What do you mean?

20:49.810 --> 20:50.310
"Agatha Kuroki's True Identity Revealed"

20:50.310 --> 20:51.520
This.

20:53.480 --> 20:56.230
"Irene Adler Orphaned At Young Age
Father Vanished, Mother Died
Born in Kabukicho?"

20:53.480 --> 20:56.230
Oh, who told the gossip rags that?

20:56.230 --> 20:58.320
She did it herself.

20:58.320 --> 21:01.990
She was an odd kid.

21:01.990 --> 21:05.870
I looked after her for a while, you know.

22:37.040 --> 22:40.380
"Irene's Hotel"

22:46.550 --> 22:48.890
Could you help?

22:48.890 --> 22:50.220
Tell me more.

22:50.220 --> 22:52.060
The victim's name is Milverton.

22:52.060 --> 22:55.180
He took two shots to the chest last night.

22:55.180 --> 22:57.270
That's one for the cold case files.

22:57.270 --> 22:58.860
What do you mean?

22:58.860 --> 23:00.980
There's too many suspects.

23:06.070 --> 23:08.280
Yes? Hello?

23:08.280 --> 23:10.620
What? Jack is back?

23:10.620 --> 23:13.040
Got it! On my way now!

23:13.040 --> 23:14.160
It's really him?

23:14.160 --> 23:15.160
Probably.

23:15.160 --> 23:16.580
The victim was another woman.

23:16.580 --> 23:20.540
Agatha Kuroki, the woman who's
been in the news all the time lately.

23:20.540 --> 23:23.340
I'm on my way to the crime scene...

23:26.760 --> 23:28.090
What's wrong?

23:41.810 --> 23:42.900
Someone's after your life, aren't they?

23:42.900 --> 23:43.980
"Give back the egg"

23:47.070 --> 23:48.990
And it's Jack the Ripper.

23:49.860 --> 23:52.530
"That Woman's Pad"

23:49.860 --> 23:52.530
There's somewhere I want to take you.

23:52.530 --> 23:54.870
I'll be with you until the end!

23:54.870 --> 23:56.830
"The Pink Elephant" "An elephant sculpture
on top of the Elephant Building.
Popular with tourists, it roars every 3 hours."
